 r←Test_ProcessTool_007(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;n;list;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool". Process via the menu bar. Supresses the "Process" button.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.posn←30 40
 list←('one' 'two' 'three' 'four' 'five' 'six' 'seven' 'eight' 'nine'),[0.5]1+⍳9
 parms.default←(1+⍳9)∊3 5
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.info←'Checks whether <enter> works with "processBtnCaption" set'
 parms.menuCaption←'My command'
 parms.menuItemCaptions←'Process now!'
 parms.processBtnCaption←''
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.Create list'∆HarvestSelections'
 ⎕DL 0.3
 {}1 ⎕NQ n.menubar.processCmd0'Select'
 →GoToTidyUp n.∆result≢,⊂list[3 5-1;]
 →GoToTidyUp n.menubar.processCmd0.Caption≢⎕IO⊃,parms.menuItemCaptions
 →GoToTidyUp n.menubar.special.Caption≢parms.menuCaption
 →GoToTidyUp 1≠⍴n.∆buttons
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
